{"parentUuid":"24a01733-b14a-4a5f-8bb3-ac6ad4c1789d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"6c4a761c-a8e3-41d0-be4c-bcb70c4b215e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about their computer performance issues - it's been sluggish, they suspect graphics driver problems, some software can't download, and sometimes the system freezes but audio continues. This is a general tech support question, not related to game development or the project context.\n\nLet me think about what could cause these symptoms:\n\n1. Computer feeling sluggish/slow\n2. Suspect graphics driver issues\n3. Some software can't download\n4. System freezes but audio continues playing\n\nThese symptoms could point to several things:\n\n1. **Graphics driver issues** - indeed could cause freezing, sluggishness. The fact that audio continues when the system \"freezes\" suggests the GPU driver is crashing/recovering while other system components keep running.\n\n2. **Disk issues** - A failing or nearly full SSD/HDD could cause sluggishness and download problems (if there's not enough space).\n\n3. **Memory issues** - Bad RAM or memory pressure could cause freezing.\n\n4. **Thermal throttling** - If the CPU/GPU is overheating, performance drops dramatically.\n\n5. **Malware or background processes** - Something consuming resources.\n\n6. **Driver conflict** - Especially if they recently updated something.\n\nSince they're on Windows 11, I should suggest some diagnostic steps. But I should also be careful - I'm a coding assistant, not a hardware technician. I'll give practical suggestions.\n\nLet me provide a helpful response with diagnostic steps they can take.","signature":"6c4a761c-a8e3-41d0-be4c-bcb70c4b215e"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35642,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":703,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5de4734a-596f-4aba-9e34-7a43d7ded590","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:40:03.081Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"2eda7540-38cf-41a6-86e3-0690a38c2c72","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"5de4734a-596f-4aba-9e34-7a43d7ded590","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"6c4a761c-a8e3-41d0-be4c-bcb70c4b215e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这几个症状组合在一起，有几个比较可能的方向：\n\n## 最可能的原因\n\n**显卡驱动崩溃（TDR - Timeout Detection & Recovery）** — 死机但有声音是最典型的特征。Windows 检测到 GPU 无响应超过 2 秒后会尝试重置显卡驱动，这期间画面卡死但音频（走 CPU）继续播放。驱动重置成功后画面恢复，失败则蓝屏。\n\n## 排查步骤（按优先级）\n\n**1. 先看系统事件日志确认**\n```\n! wevtutil qe System /c:10 /rd:true /f:text /q:\"*[System[Provider[@Name='Display']]]\"\n```\n\n如果看到 \"Display driver nvlddmkm/amdkmdag stopped responding\" 之类的记录，基本就是显卡驱动的问题。\n\n**2. 软件下载不了** 可能是存储问题：\n- 检查磁盘剩余空间，SSD 剩余 <10% 性能会断崖下降\n- 检查磁盘健康：`wmic diskdrive get status`\n\n**3. 其他可能**\n- **内存不稳**：XMP/DOCP 超频导致偶发 freeze，音频继续说明 CPU 没完全挂\n- **芯片组驱动过时**：影响磁盘 I/O 和 PCIe 稳定性\n- **Windows 11 已知问题**：某些版本 + 特定硬件组合有 DPC 延迟高的 bug\n\n## 建议先做的\n\n1. 用 DDU（Display Driver Uninstaller）在安全模式下彻底清除显卡驱动，然后装最新版或回退一个稳定版本\n2. 检查 SSD 剩余空间和健康状态\n3. 跑一次 `sfc /scannow` + `dism /online /cleanup-image /restorehealth`\n4. 如果有开 XMP，暂时关掉试一段时间\n\n你可以先跑一下上面的 event log 命令，把结果贴给我，我能更精确判断。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35642,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":703,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"01ac6699-0d87-407a-8b82-3b2cb9caa51d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:40:17.991Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"2eda7540-38cf-41a6-86e3-0690a38c2c72","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
