{"parentUuid":"51d561be-bb78-4656-a535-a6ba3a5441d9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"fbf7cc48-2707-46f1-bd67-14a87c5beebe","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The download completed. Let me analyze the findings:\n\n1. **HwSchMode = 2**: This means Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling (HAGS) is ON. This is a common cause of issues on AMD GPUs. Turning it off is a common fix.\n\n2. **MPO OverlayTestMode**: Not set (no output), meaning MPO is using default behavior. This is another common trouble spot for AMD + Windows 11.\n\n3. **Application crashes**: No output for Event ID 1000 or 1002 in the last 50 entries.\n\n4. **Registry settings**:\n   - UnsupportedMonitorModesAllowed = 1 (this allows unsupported monitor modes, could be related to display issues)\n   - PlatformSupportMiracast = 1\n\nNow, let me check the download result. The download completed (exit code 0) so the file should exist. Let me verify.\n\nActually, let me summarize what I've found so far and give clear recommendations:\n\n1. The user IS on the latest AMD driver (32.0.31007.5012 = Adrenalin 26.5.2)\n2. HAGS (Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling) is ON - this is a known problem for AMD GPUs\n3. MPO is at default settings\n\nThe most likely culprits now are:\n1. **HAGS ON** - very common cause of AMD GPU hangs in Windows 11\n2. **MPO** - Multi-Plane Overlay can cause black screens and stuttering on AMD\n3. Possibly PCIe link issues or SAM\n\nLet me tell the user that they're on the latest driver and suggest turning off HAGS and disabling MPO.\n\nActually, I also want to verify the downloaded file exists. Let me check.","signature":"fbf7cc48-2707-46f1-bd67-14a87c5beebe"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51968,"output_tokens":688,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b1941dec-6b54-4efb-8447-0a34efd6d286","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:51:41.330Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"2eda7540-38cf-41a6-86e3-0690a38c2c72","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"b1941dec-6b54-4efb-8447-0a34efd6d286","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"fbf7cc48-2707-46f1-bd67-14a87c5beebe","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"下载完成。综合所有诊断数据，给你最终结论：\n\n---\n\n## 最终诊断\n\n### 你已经是最新驱动\n`32.0.31007.5012` = **Adrenalin 26.5.2 WHQL**（2026/5/15），不需要更新。\n\n### 找到两个可疑配置\n\n| 设置 | 当前值 | 问题 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| **硬件加速 GPU 调度 (HAGS)** | **开启** (HwSchMode=2) | AMD 卡 + HAGS = 已知会导致卡死/黑屏 |\n| **MPO (Multi-Plane Overlay)** | 默认（未设） | AMD + Win11 默认 MPO = 间歇卡顿 |\n\n这两个是 AMD 显卡在 Windows 11 上**最常见**的卡顿/死机原因，比驱动版本问题更普遍。\n\n### 建议立即尝试\n\n1. **关掉 HAGS**：设置 → 系统 → 屏幕 → 显示卡 → 默认图形设置 → 关闭「硬件加速 GPU 调度」→ 重启\n\n2. 如果还卡，**禁用 MPO**，我可以直接帮你改注册表：\n   ```\n   HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm\n   新建 DWORD: OverlayTestMode = 5，重启\n   ```\n\n要我帮你直接写入注册表禁用 MPO 吗？（需要管理员权限，改完重启才生效）"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":51968,"output_tokens":688,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"db1f1a74-0a0a-433d-a826-e6710d82b766","timestamp":"2026-05-20T12:51:51.300Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"2eda7540-38cf-41a6-86e3-0690a38c2c72","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
